    <p id="loadTime" class="animate font-bold pr-2 pt-1 underline"></p>
   </div>
    <h4 class="animate text-xl font-semibold text-black dark:text-white mb-2">
      Hi, I'm Miheer <span class="text-xl">👋🏻</span> 
